# 同步到 https://github.com/spjiang/spectrum-mosaic
# 固定不传：mosaic/server/data 测区数据、密钥、可再生成依赖

.env
**/.env
!**/.env.example

**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/node_modules/
**/.DS_Store
*.pyc
*.pyo

# 数据集目录（不上传；保留空目录占位）
mosaic/server/data/input/**
!mosaic/server/data/input/.gitkeep
mosaic/server/data/output/**
!mosaic/server/data/output/runs/
!mosaic/server/data/output/runs/.gitkeep
mosaic/server/data/.inspect/
mosaic/server/data/.worker/
mosaic/server/.run/
mosaic/server/frontend/dist/

# 对比用检出，只读。不提交、不修改。
mosaic/gcp/

# 下列与 data 同类、体积过大（GitHub 放不下）；sync 脚本默认也排除。
# INCLUDE_ALL_DATASETS=1 时可尝试纳入（仍受 100MB 单文件限制）。
docs/需求/拼图数据集/
docs/需求/测试结果验证数据/
docs/需求/测试正式数据/
docs/需求/无人机数据/
test/work/
test/out/
test/input_bench/

# 发版台密钥与产物（私钥严禁入库）
release/keys/*
!release/keys/.gitkeep
release/artifacts/**
!release/artifacts/.gitkeep
release/build/.embed/license_public.pem
release/server/frontend/node_modules/
release/server/frontend/dist/

.worktrees/
